<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile clarifies antimony ore sale.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile clarifies antimony ore sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said its statement on a sale of antimony sulfide ore, issued June 4, should be disregarded.</p>
<p>Stockpile's marketing manager Peter Roman said no sale has been concluded and further clarification would be given at a later date.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
